# Review handoff

Each review report updates the Now / Next / Open decisions block in
`docs/README.md` in the same change. That block is the single source for
current work. See `docs/reviews/README.md` for the report conventions.

When Zach approves an increment, or asks for the wrap-up, give both of these
in the same reply. Do not start the next increment in that reply.

1. **Commit message.** One or two sentences that say why the change exists.
   Do not commit unless Zach asks.
2. **Next-chat prompt.** A paste-ready block that names `AGENTS.md`,
   `docs/README.md`, the latest review, `docs/reviews/README.md`, and the
   pending decision or next roadmap item. A new chat should be able to start
   from those files alone.

Stay in the current chat if the increment is unfinished or the reasoning is
not in the repository yet.
